@startuml

title PENA-Agent — Runtime Activity Pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  ArrowColor #444444
}

skinparam note {
  BorderColor #666666
  BackgroundColor #FFFCE8
}

start

:Load user context;
:Load project / repository context;
:Retrieve candidate articles;
:Normalize article metadata;
:Deduplicate repeated content;
:Categorize articles;
:Evaluate source trust;
:Generate summaries;
:Rank relevance;
:Generate structured digest;
:Persist digest output;
:Record observability events;

if (User feedback available?) then (yes)
  :Capture feedback;
  :Create learning signal;
  :Update context candidates;
else (no)
  :Mark digest as unreviewed;
endif

:Prepare next iteration inputs;

stop

note right
This activity pipeline is intentionally simple.

It defines the first executable flow:
context → articles → trust → summary → digest → observations → learning.
end note

note bottom
The pipeline should stay small enough for POC execution,
but explicit enough to become AI-readable specification context.
end note

@enduml
